title: BallThrow
---
Sparkles: You like balls?
-> Ofcourse! I love them!
    Sparkles: Well, you are in LUCK!!!
    Sparkles: In this game your goal is to throw THE balls against those cans over there!
    Sparkles: Take some time charging that throw beforehand!
    Sparkles: When you knock the cans over YOU GET POINTS!!!
    Sparkles: WOOOOOOOOO!!
-> No, I hate them!
    Sparkles: Shame.
===

title: Shooter
---
Sparkles: Wanna shoot someone?
-> YES PLEASE!
    Sparkles: Well, go grab that GUN over there!
    Sparkles: And start BLASTING!!!
    Sparkles: You will only have LIMITED bullets PER round.
    Sparkles: Which is a shame, tbh.
    Sparkles: Oh, I almost forgot. You can NOT try and shoot other people.
    Sparkles: We got a lot of complaints last year about that.
-> No...
    Sparkles: Americans wouldve said yes...
===

title: HammerGame
---
Sparkles: You like to smash?
-> I mean... I could try?
    Sparkles: Well, just grab the hammer over there!
    Sparkles: And SMASH this weird thing called a "Space Bar?" a bunch of times.
    Sparkles: Although I don't know how they earn anything since it's literally in space. But oh well.
    Sparkles: Be sure to do it AS FAST as possible!
    Sparkles: We have got to reach this bar somehow.
-> Get away you weirdo...
    Sparkles: Well I'M sorry.
===

title: WhackAMole
---
Sparkles: It's time to whack A mole!!!
Player: Weird way to say that, but...
->  Sure?
    Sparkles: Get back that ENTHUSIASM!!
    Sparkles: This is a FUNfair after all!
    Sparkles: In this game you gotta WHACK. THOSE. MOLES!
    Sparkles: However, they are fighting back somehow...[]+
    Sparkles: Just make sure not to whack the bombs.
    Sparkles: Don't ask me how they got them. I don't know either…
-> Not if you say it like that...
    Sparkles: You are no fun.
===

title: Hidden
---
Sprinkle: Oh, you found me!
Sprinkle: Could you not tell Sparkles about this place?
Sprinkle: Sometimes her games get a little… intense.
===

title: StoreEnoughTickets
---
Sprinkle: What prize do you want?
Player: That one!
Sprinkle: Alright! Here ya go.
===

title: StoreNotEnoughTickets
---
Sprinkle: What prize do you want?
Player: That one!
Sprinkle: You don't have enough tickets for that!
-> How do I get tickets?
    Sprinkle: Play more games!
    Sprinkle: How else do you think you're gonna get any of these FUN prizes!
    Sprinkle: And don't forget to YANK those tickets out of the machine when you're done!
-> Gosh darn it...
    Sprinkle: Maybe next time!
===